@ERP_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

GET {{ERP_Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Legal module discovery status
GET {{ERP_Api_HostAddress}}/api/legal/status
Accept: application/json

### Case list stays unavailable until the Oracle schema is validated
GET {{ERP_Api_HostAddress}}/api/legal/cases
Accept: application/json
